          <choice_text>_(26)Fe: [Ar]4$s$^(2)3$d$^(6)</choice_text>
          <commentary>옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[X] (정답)">
          <choice_text>_(29)Cu: [Ar]4$s$^(2)3$d$^(9)</choice_text>
          <commentary>[Ar]4s¹3d¹⁰이므로 옳지 않아 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>_(30)Zn: [Ar]4$s$^(2)3$d$^(10)</choice_text>
          <commentary>옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
