    <question_explanation no="8" id="PRB-42690C134E38CDD2-Q8">
      <question_stem>2.0 L 용기에서 H_(2)($g$) 0.01 mol, I_(2)($g$) 0.04 mol, HI($g$) 0.02 mol로 다음 반응을 시작할 때, 반응 지수(Q)는?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="수치/계산 도출형" category="수리·계산·자료해석형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>용기에서</keyword>
        <keyword>반응</keyword>
        <keyword>시작할</keyword>
        <keyword>지수</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>1</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>1</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답가안</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 화학 · 반응 지수
정답은 ①이다. 각 농도는 [H₂] = 0.01 ÷ 2 = 0.005 M, [I₂] = 0.04 ÷ 2 = 0.02 M, [HI] = 0.02 ÷ 2 = 0.01 M이다. Q = [HI]² ÷ ([H₂][I₂]) = (0.01)² ÷ (0.005 × 0.02) = 10⁻⁴ ÷ 10⁻⁴ = 1이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>1</choice_text>
          <commentary>1이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>2</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>3</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>4</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
